WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Nineteen seconds and still no plant. Don't push forward on your own.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.900 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Full armor and an AK: hold the A ramp and wait for your team to rotate back.

3
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: I just took one out. Can we hold the site?

4
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:27.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: You can hold it. Full armor, AK, on the site, forty seconds to go. Just stay steady.

5
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:32.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Nice! Three headshots in fifteen seconds. That was awesome.

6
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.900 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: It's a pistol round. Which spot should I hold?

7
00:00:40.900 --> 00:00:46.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Hold mid doors. Full armor, knife out, you're in a safe spot. Lock down the mid crossing.

8
00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:55.300 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Movement at mid doors. Should I fall back?

9
00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:02.500 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Not yet. It's 3 against 4, but with full armor and the USP, peek mid doors, take one, then pull back.

10
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Don't take the duel! Only nine bullets left. Fall back behind the site and wait for a crossfire.

11
00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:15.700 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Great headshot! That USP shot was spot on, and it evens up the numbers.

12
00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:20.800 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: I'm dead. Was I too hasty just now?

13
00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:25.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: A little. You were down to nineteen health and got finished off.

14
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:29.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Next time there's movement at mid doors, fall back behind the site first.

15
00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:34.600 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: So I'll buy a rifle this round. Do I keep holding A short?

16
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:41.400 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: No problem. Full armor and an M4A1-S: lock down the short stairs and wait for backup.

17
00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:46.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: I'm set up here. Will they come through short?

18
00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:54.300 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: They might. You have a smoke grenade, so be ready to throw it.

19
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:58.400 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
User: Both in short are dead. Where's the last one?

20
00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:06.100 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Can't see them. You still have a smoke: throw it, then hold the short stairs.

21
00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:12.000 line:0 position:50% size:84% align:center
Jarvis: Run! You're down to nineteen health. Fall back now and switch to your rifle.
